    tagline:  { zh: '在三國志的地圖上逐鹿天下：四十五座城、五百名武將，戰鬥是曹操傳式的回合制戰棋。', en: 'Fight for the realm on the map of the Three Kingdoms: 45 cities, 500 officers, and battles fought like Cao Cao Den.' },
    about:    { zh: '選一個劇本（群雄討董、官渡、赤壁、三國鼎立……）和一位君主。每個月，武將們開墾、經商、築城、徵兵、搜索人才與寶物、登用在野之士；與鄰國開戰時，帶最多十名武將出征。戰鬥是曹操傳式戰棋：我軍全部行動完換敵軍，騎兵剋步兵、步兵剋弓兵、弓兵剋騎兵，地形影響移動與防禦，被打的部隊會反擊，還有火計、水計、落石、混亂、援助等三十種策略。十種兵種、三階晉升，俘虜可以登用、釋放或處斬，統一四十五座城就是天下統一。',
                en: 'Choose a scenario (the stand against Dong Zhuo, Guandu, Red Cliffs, the Three Kingdoms…) and a warlord. Each month your officers farm, trade, build walls, draft troops, search for talent and treasure, and recruit the unaffiliated; when you go to war, up to ten officers march. Battles play like Cao Cao Den: your whole army moves, then theirs; cavalry beat infantry, infantry beat archers, archers beat cavalry; terrain shapes movement and defence; struck units hit back; and thirty strategies — fire, floods, rockfall, confusion, relief and more. Ten unit lines with three tiers, captives to recruit, release or execute, and forty-five cities to unite.' },
    controls: { zh: '點城市看情報、下指令 · 戰鬥：點部隊→點藍格移動→選攻擊／策略／道具／待機 · 點敵軍看範圍與情報 · 拖曳移動地圖、滾輪縮放 · X/Esc 取消', en: 'Tap a city for its panel and orders · in battle: tap a unit, a blue tile, then Attack / Strategy / Item / Wait · tap a foe for its range and details · drag to scroll, wheel to zoom · X/Esc back' },
