    players: '1',
    added: '2026-10-20',
    title:    { zh: '灰燼詠嘆調', en: 'Ash Aria' },
    tagline:  { zh: '一個關於歌與沉默的原創 JRPG：鐘聲擋住灰潮，鐘卻是用星靈熔成的。十五位各有專屬指令的同伴、ATB 戰鬥、起承轉合四幕。', en: 'An original JRPG about song and silence: bells hold back the Ashtide, and the bells are made of melted Astrals. Fifteen companions with their own commands, ATB battles and four acts.' },
    about:    { zh: '艾瑟蘭是一個會唱歌的世界，萬物都是「星歌」的一部分。人們用鐘聲擋住吞噬一切的灰潮——而聖詠院的鐘，是把星靈熔進去做成的。沒有影子的少女艾莉雅，被大指揮者歐瑟當成「樂器」養大；她在霜石鎮的礦坑裡聽見冰封星靈的歌，第一次說了「不」。和灰路信使洛恩、風琴城的工匠艾德蒙、回音寺的拳僧賽伊、快要失明的老刀匠桐生、馬戲團的馴獸男孩嘉藍、燈塔的守鐘騎士瑟琳娜、雲鯨牧人雷吉斯、帶著老鷹的賞金獵人夜鴉、見習抄寫員莉莉、怪物學者波洛、雪狐狐巫摩卡、守護石像烏瑪、鏡廳的映影鏡，以及審判官雷歐娜一起旅行。溫柔的反派歐瑟想讓整首星歌停下來，演奏讓世界安靜睡去的「終止符」。每個人都有專屬指令：回音化、妙手、機巧、用方向鍵敲節奏的拳鳴、蓄勢的居合、模仿魔物的馴獸、吸收魔法的吸音劍、按鍵停下的天候輪、投擲、謄錄、識技、風土歌、暴走、映照。三條河流的分線、在大音樂會上用對位旋律喚醒被控制的艾莉雅、審判、燃燒的書庫——然後三口巨鐘同時響起，世界失去了聲音。一年後，洛恩在燈塔醒來，撿起一枚會哼歌的貝殼，一個一個找回同伴、打倒吞下艾莉雅八個音的不協之獸，在安息之塔頂端把她唱回來。十二章的主線，加上 41 件信使公會的委託（不少是好幾封信串成的小故事）、20 張賞金榜、13 段同伴篇章（各自的迷宮與專屬武器）和十層的灰潮深淵，第一次玩約 40–55 小時。像素魔物美術、兩個世界地圖、雲鯨、依找回的音與同伴而變化的結局。中英文都可以玩。',
                en: 'Etheran is a world that sings: everything in it is part of the Star Song. People hold back the all-devouring Ashtide with the sound of bells, and the Choir makes its bells by melting Astrals into them. Aria, a girl with no shadow, was raised as an "instrument" by the High Conductor Orsay; in the mines of Frostvale she hears a frozen Astral sing and, for the first time, says no. She travels with Rowan the Ash-Road courier, Edmund the wind-organ artificer, Sai the monk of the Echo Temple, Kiriyu the old swordsmith going blind, Galan the circus beast-tamer, Selene the lighthouse Bell Warden, Regis the cloud-whale herder, Nightcrow the bounty hunter and her hawk, Lili the apprentice scribe, Bolo the monster scholar, Moka the fox shrine maiden, Uma the stone guardian, Kagami of the Hall of Mirrors, and Leona the Magistrate. Their gentle enemy Orsay wants the Star Song to stop: to play the Final Rest and let the world fall peacefully asleep. Every companion has a command of their own: Echo Form, Pilfer, Gadgets, Fist Echoes beaten out on the arrow keys, charged Iai, Beastcall, the spell-swallowing Hushblade, a Weather Wheel you stop by hand, Throw, Transcribe, Studied Arts, Land Song, Rampage and Reflect. Three rivers to follow in Act I, a counter-melody sung to wake Aria at the Grand Concert, a trial, a burning archive — and then three great bells ring together and the world loses its sound. A year later Rowan wakes in a lighthouse, picks up a humming shell, finds his friends one by one, defeats the Discordant Beasts that swallowed Aria\'s eight notes, and sings her back at the top of the Tower of Rest. Twelve chapters of story, plus 41 Courier Guild deliveries (many of them little stories told over several letters), 20 bounties, 13 companion episodes (each with its own dungeon and ultimate weapon) and the ten-floor Ashtide Abyss: roughly 40–55 hours for a first playthrough. Pixel-art monsters, two world maps, a cloud whale to fly, and an ending that changes with the notes and friends you find. In Chinese and English.' },
    controls: { zh: '方向鍵/WASD 移動 · Z/空白/Enter 確定、對話 · X/Esc 選單、取消 · M 音樂 · 戰鬥中選單打開時時間會停止 · 手機有方向鍵與按鈕', en: 'Arrows/WASD move · Z/Space/Enter confirm and talk · X/Esc menu and cancel · M music · time stops while a battle menu is open · touch d-pad and buttons on phones' },
