    title:    { zh: '葉葉跳跳 3D', en: 'Leaf Leap 3D' },
    tagline:  { zh: '3D 版的瑪利歐 3 冒險：狸貓裝飛天變石像、青蛙裝游泳、黑桃翻牌、蘑菇小屋和飛行船！', en: 'A 3D Mario 3 style adventure: fly and turn to stone in the Tanooki Suit, swim in the Frog Suit, play the spade cards, and storm the airship!' },
    about:    { zh: '致敬超級瑪利歐兄弟 3 的 3D 平台遊戲。在世界地圖上沿著小路前進：七個關卡（包括海底關卡）、兩間蘑菇小屋、黑桃翻牌遊戲、石頭堡壘和飛行船。神奇葉子給你狸貓尾巴：轉圈甩尾、慢慢飄落、跑步集滿 P 計量表起飛；狸貓裝還能在地上按住蹬地鍵變成石像，什麼都傷不了你；青蛙裝在水裡游得最快、可以往任何方向游，在陸地上則一跳一跳地前進；P 翅膀讓你整關都能飛。蘑菇讓你變大、火焰花丟彈跳火球。踩扁蘑菇怪、踢龜殼、小心食人花和海裡的魚，在飛行船上躲開大砲（砲彈可以踩），最後打倒揮魔杖的小王子。穿過終點線得到卡片，集三張換額外生命。簡單模式：五條命、每關都有中間點、沒有時間限制。',
                en: 'A 3D platformer in tribute to Super Mario Bros. 3. Walk the path on the world map: seven levels (one under the sea), two Mushroom Houses, a spade card game, a Stone Fortress and the airship. The Super Leaf gives you a raccoon tail: spin it, float down, and fill the P-meter by running to take off. The Tanooki Suit does all that and also turns you into a stone statue that nothing can hurt; the Frog Suit is the fastest swimmer, gliding in any direction, and hops along on land; the P-Wing lets you fly through a whole level. The Mushroom makes you big and the Fire Flower throws bouncing fireballs. Stomp Mushlings, kick shells, dodge biting plants and fish, brave the cannons on the airship (you can stomp the balls), and beat the little prince with his magic wand. Cross the finish line for a card and collect three for extra lives. Easy mode: five lives, a checkpoint in every level, and no timer.' },
    controls: { zh: '方向鍵／WASD 移動 · 空白鍵／Z 跳 · Shift／X 跑步＋丟火球＋甩尾巴 · 空中按 C 屁股蹬地 · Q／E 或拖曳 轉視角 · Esc 選單 · 控制器：左搖桿移動、右搖桿視角、A 跳、B 跑、Y 蹬地 · 手機：螢幕按鈕，拖曳轉視角', en: 'Arrows / WASD move · Space / Z jump · Shift / X run, throw fire, swing tail · C in the air: ground pound · Q / E or drag: camera · Esc menu · controller: left stick move, right stick camera, A jump, B run, Y pound · phone: on-screen buttons, drag to turn the camera' },
