    players: '1',
    added: '2026-10-10',
    title:    { zh: '月影城：夜之狂想曲', en: 'Moonshadow Castle' },
    tagline:  { zh: '像月下狂想曲一樣大的古堡探索動作 RPG：339 個房間＋逆轉城、暗黑破壞神式的寶物（暗金、套裝、寶石鑲嵌）、21 個魔王，還有怪物與裝備圖鑑。', en: 'A Symphony-of-the-Night-sized castle action RPG: 339 rooms plus a Reversed Castle, Diablo II style loot (uniques, sets, sockets), 21 bosses and a monster & item gallery.' },
    about:    { zh: '每隔一百年，月亮會在月影城上空變黑，吸血鬼伯爵沃拉斯擄走了月之巫女艾莉絲。扮演她的哥哥──銀髮劍士路西安，探索 20 個區域、339 個相連的房間（鍊金實驗室、大理石迴廊、月光庭園、鬥技場、水晶洞窟、冰封地窖、地下水道、無底深淵……），用八種聖遺物（二段跳、滑鏟、蝙蝠、霧化、潛水……）打開新路線，最後用月之瞳翻轉整座城堡進入逆轉城，挑戰真結局。寶物採用暗黑破壞神 2 的系統：100 種基礎裝備（含 12 種副武器）、普通／精良／魔法／稀有／套裝／暗金六種品質、56 件暗金、8 套套裝、7 種寶石四個等級可鑲嵌與合成、賭博、倉庫與 11 格裝備欄。圖鑑收錄 39 種怪物、21 個魔王與所有裝備，擊敗與取得的會自動記錄。',
                en: 'Once every hundred years the moon turns black over Moonshadow Castle, and Count Vorlath has taken Elise, the last moon priestess. Play as her brother Lucien and explore 20 areas and 339 connected rooms: the Alchemy Lab, Marble Gallery, Moonlit Garden, Colosseum, Crystal Caverns, Frozen Vault, Underground Waterway, the Abyss and more. Eight relics open new paths: double jump, slide, bat, mist, snorkel and others. The Eye of the Moon flips the whole castle into the Reversed Castle for the true ending. The loot works like Diablo II: 100 base items (12 of them sub-weapons) and six qualities (normal, superior, magic, rare, set, unique). There are 56 uniques, 8 sets and 7 gems in 4 grades to socket and combine. You can gamble, use a stash, and equip 11 slots. A gallery records 39 monsters, 21 bosses and every item, and marks what you have beaten and found.' },
    controls: { zh: '←→ 移動 · ↓ 蹲 · Z 跳 · X 攻擊 · ↑+X / C 副武器 · A 後跳 · S 蝙蝠 · D 霧化 · Enter 選單 · M 地圖 · 手機有虛擬搖桿與按鈕', en: '←→ move · ↓ crouch · Z jump · X attack · ↑+X / C sub-weapon · A backdash · S bat · D mist · Enter menu · M map · on-screen stick and buttons on phones' }
